# review/02-overlap-split
profile own
scope.begin s
new a A
new b B
new h H left=a right=a other=b
get left h left
get right h right
scope.split s h all
own.split all left rest selected deps
own.split rest right rest2 duplicate deps2
own.admit duplicate s
own.admit selected s
own.admit rest2 s
use left
use right
scope.end s
